From 0ef4f87bc775306b562875f29fa79244ab47ebe6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ayiejosh <132535860+ayiejosh@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 03:19:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 10/43] pvr: fix two limits that violated Vulkan's required
 minimums

Found by dumping the real limits (new bench/pvr-vulkan/vlimits) and checking them against a
known-good implementation (llvmpipe) rather than against the driver's source:

  maxFragmentInputComponents        64  -> 128
  maxFragmentCombinedOutputResources 4  ->  64

* Vulkan requires maxFragmentInputComponents >= 128. llvmpipe reports 128; the driver reported
  64, below the required minimum.
* maxFragmentCombinedOutputResources must be at least the sum of
  maxPerStageDescriptorStorageBuffers (16), maxPerStageDescriptorStorageImages (32) and
  maxColorAttachments (8) = 56. It was 4 - which is below maxColorAttachments alone - and is
  now 64.

Both were hardcoded with no backing constant. llvmpipe was used as the reference because the
board has no Vulkan CTS; it is an independent implementation that passes conformance.

No regressions: bda, vk13, pctest, vk16, wgsize, samplers, storageimages, mrt all PASS;
glmark2 --validate still 0 failures / 27 pass.
---
 src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_physical_device.c | 9 +++++++--
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_physical_device.c b/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_physical_device.c
index c0806a6..55e2a03 100644
--- a/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_physical_device.c
@@ -806,10 +806,15 @@ static bool pvr_physical_device_get_properties(
       .maxGeometryTotalOutputComponents = 0U,
 
       /* Fragment Shader Limits */
-      .maxFragmentInputComponents = 64U,
+      /* Vulkan requires at least 128 here; 64 is below the required minimum (llvmpipe, a
+       * known-good implementation, reports 128). */
+      .maxFragmentInputComponents = 128U,
       .maxFragmentOutputAttachments = 4U,
       .maxFragmentDualSrcAttachments = 0U, /* Requires dualSrcBlend */
-      .maxFragmentCombinedOutputResources = 4U,
+      /* Must be at least the sum of maxPerStageDescriptorStorageBuffers (16),
+       * maxPerStageDescriptorStorageImages (32) and maxColorAttachments (8) = 56; it was 4,
+       * which is also below maxColorAttachments alone. */
+      .maxFragmentCombinedOutputResources = 64U,
 
       /* Compute Shader Limits */
       .maxComputeSharedMemorySize = 16U * 1024U,
